WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:01.680
(dramatic music)

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.870
- Imagine you're getting
ready to go to the gym,

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.700
you grab your keys and your bag,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.398
and then you take a supplement,

00:00:07.398 --> 00:00:09.780
and you feel like it's working.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.510
It might be working a little too well.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.880
What you don't know is
that this supplement,

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.560
one that you bought at the health aisle

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.825
at your grocery store is laced
with an anabolic steroid,

00:00:19.825 --> 00:00:24.030
an illegal drug invisibly
mixed into this powder.

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:25.860
In recent years researchers have been

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:26.790
grabbing thousands

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.440
