00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:31.920
And what they found

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.635
in over 3000 supplements that they tested

00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:38.670
is that 28% had some sort
of illegal substance,

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.985
mostly steroids, meaning the
people that are taking them

00:00:41.985 --> 00:00:44.253
are unintentionally doping.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.550
In another study, 92% of the
supplements that were tested

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.580
by scientists were
contaminated with bacteria.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.463
87% had fungal contamination,

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.662
And when they tested CBD supplements

00:00:59.662 --> 00:01:03.655
they found that 55% of the
oils had either way more

00:01:03.655 --> 00:01:07.350
or way less CBD than stated on the label.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:10.110
And a few of them even had THC in them,

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:11.910
the thing that gets you high.

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:14.193
And it turns out the government
here in the United States

00:01:14.193 --> 00:01:16.500
doesn't seem to care.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.970
So how did we get here?

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.850
And why are shady companies,
influencer campaigns

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.200
and targeted advertisements

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.211
selling Americans things
to put in their body

00:01:24.211 --> 00:01:26.730
that aren't what they say they are,

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.440
and that are potentially dangerous?

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.020
And I guess a big question for me is

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.440
which of these are actually
necessary or healthy?

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.540
And which of them are dangerous?

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.742
And is this all just a waste of money?

00:01:38.742 --> 00:01:41.325
(gentle music)

